<title>USA: Intelect Comms enters deal with Licom.</title>
<headline>Intelect Comms enters deal with Licom.</headline>
<dateline>RICHARDSON, Texas 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intelect Inc, a wholly owned subsidiary of Intelect Communications Systems Ltd, said on Tuesday that it had entered into a new distribution agreement with Licom Inc.</p>
<p>In a release, Intelect said Licom, a wholly owned subsidiary of V Band Corp, will remarket Intelect's SONETLYNX OC-3/STS-1 digital fiber-optic multiplexers for energy market applications.</p>
<p>Licom, a communications industry supplier based in Herndon, Va., will repackage Intelect's SONETLYNX under the name Pro155 for its customers, Intelect said.</p>
</text>
